#: ../../functions/func_datetime.rst:6
msgid "$datetime"
msgstr ""

#: ../../functions/func_datetime.rst:8
msgid "Usage: **$datetime([format])**"
msgstr "用法：**$datetime([format])**"

#: ../../functions/func_datetime.rst:9
msgid "Category: information"
msgstr "类别：信息"

#: ../../functions/func_datetime.rst:10
msgid "Implemented: Picard 2.3"
msgstr "实现：Picard 2.3"

#: ../../functions/func_datetime.rst:12
msgid "**Description:**"
msgstr "**描述：**"

#: ../../functions/func_datetime.rst:14
msgid "Returns the current date and time in the specified format, which is based on the standard Python ``strftime`` `format codes <https://strftime.org>`_. If no format is specified the date and time will be returned in the form '2020-02-15 14:26:32'."
msgstr ""
"以指定的格式返回当前日期和时间，该格式基于标准的 Python ``strftime`` `format "
"codes <https://strftime.org>`_。如果未指定格式，日期和时间将按 '2020-02-15 "
"14:26:32' 的形式返回。"

#: ../../functions/func_datetime.rst:18
msgid "Any special characters such as '%', '$', '(', ')' and '\\\\' will need to be escaped as shown in the examples below."
msgstr "任何特殊字符，如 '%', '$', '(', ')' 和 '\\'，都需要像下面示例中那样转义。"

#: ../../functions/func_datetime.rst:22
msgid "Platform-specific formatting codes should be avoided to help ensure the portability of scripts across the different platforms. These codes include: remove zero-padding (e.g.: ``%-d`` and ``%-m`` on Linux or macOS, and their equivalents ``%#d`` and ``%#m`` on Windows); element length specifiers (e.g.: ``%3Y``); and hanging '%' at the end of the format string."
msgstr ""
"应避免使用平台特定的格式代码，以确保脚本在不同平台上的可移植性。这些代码包括"
"：移除零填充（例如：Linux 或 macOS 上的 ``%-d`` 和 ``%-m``，以及 Windows 上的"
"等效 ``%#d`` 和 ``%#m``）；元素长度指定符（例如：``%3Y``）；以及格式字符串末"
"尾的悬挂 '%'。"

